    "created_at": "2024-07-17T12:04:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-17T13:15:09Z",
    "body": "Another resolution difference:\r\n`<meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0; url=/target.html\">`\r\n\r\n### Updated with the confirmed difference: \r\nOpening the local file path in the browser (instead of via a web server):\r\n\r\nFirefox 128: ignores/rejects the redirect\r\nEdge 126 (Chromium) redirects to `localDirContainingThePage/target.html`\r\n\r\n### Original (wrong / did not reproduced with isolated example):\r\nOpening the page in a web server.\r\n\r\nFirefox 128: ignores/rejects the redirect\r\nEdge 126 (Chromium) redirects to `https://example.com/target.html`\r\n",
